# End-to-end verification before commit / deploy

Before committing or deploying changes to **fortress-ai**, run from the repo root:

```bash
./scripts/e2e_verify.sh
```

Use `./scripts/e2e_verify.sh --no-ingest` if you must avoid network (skips domain ingest; unit tests only).

To verify **both** fortress-ai and sibling `trading-bot` on the same host:

```bash
./scripts/e2e_all_repos.sh
```

Do not treat a change as ready until the relevant script exits **0**.
